From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:39:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] ci: add root pre-commit hooks, shared configs, PR title
 check, dependabot

- .pre-commit-config.yaml runs each tool's existing linters and formatters with its own config files, passed explicitly and scoped to the tool folder (one hook per tool where settings differ); query-tool's lint-staged checks, its CI spelling check and its post-merge npm ci become hooks; pre-commit.ci settings (hooks that need Docker or node_modules are skipped there). Installed once with `pre-commit install` at the root. The tools' own .pre-commit-config.yaml files stay unchanged for the old repositories.
- shared/ and scripts/sync-shared.py: configs shared by several tools live once in shared/ and are copied into the tool folders listed in shared/files.yaml (commit hook, fails on a differing copy). The list starts empty.
- pr-checks.yml: conventional PR titles (action-semantic-pull-request, optional tool scope).
- .github/dependabot.yml replaces the per-repo copies; adds grouped Docker base image updates (no major or python minor updates).
- Root pull request template.
